      concept('Loop prevention and redundancy', 'Spanning Tree blocks redundant Layer 2 paths to prevent loops while retaining failover potential.', 'a topology change activates a backup link without allowing broadcast storms.', 'disabling loop prevention because redundant links seem faster')
